# File-message asymmetry witness (DESIGN-M4 Surprises 7/section 5): the
# wrapper quotes the path (NBSP as \u00a0) while the inner PathError
# renders it raw —
# runtime error: cannot open "\u00a0name.txt": open <raw NBSP>name.txt: no such file or directory.
# The literal below carries a raw NBSP inside the quotes.

let text = file.read(" name.txt") try
print text
